  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Nylon is a polyamide fibre. It is prepared by the condensation polymerisation of adipic acid (HOOC. $\\left.\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_2\\right)_4 \\mathrm{COOH}\\right)$ and hexamethylene diamine $\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{~N} \\cdot\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_2\\right)_6 \\cdot \\mathrm{NH}_2\\right)$.",
